--------------> Taint <---------------   advance version is   --->  Replace <----

if we created server over terraform however few servers are not working this situation we have to recreate server 
will apply taint for same server for create in the place of which is not working with same configeration 

terraform taint aws_instance.Manval   ( Server id)
Terraform apply 

so will notice destroting old server ans creating a new server along with same configeration

terraform apply --auto-approve -replace="aws_instance.Manval"


here we may face downtime while creating new one and deleting old one


------> Terraform Lifecycle <-----------

Main.tf we have to add lifecycle

resource "aws_instance" "Manval" {
  ami           = "ami-0521cb2d60cfbb1a6"
  instance_type = "t3.micro"

  tags = {
    Name = "terraform"
  }
  lifecycle {
    create_before_destroy = true
  }
}



terraform apply --auto-approve -replace="aws_instance.Manval"

